1
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,330
-What's up? -I left my guitar here.
-怎麼了？ -我忘了拿吉他

2
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:13,010
Okay. No problem.
好吧，沒問題

3
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:18,310
Okay. Here you go.
拿去吧

4
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:26,140
-What? -You want to hang out or something?
-什麼？ -你要聊聊嗎？

5
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:29,120
You caught me at a bad time.
你來的不是時候

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,990
-Are you and Chandler..? -Exactly.
-你跟錢德… -沒錯

7
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:34,090
-Can I play for you? -No.
-要我幫你們伴奏嗎？ -不必

8
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:39,830
Hey, Pheebs, what's up?
菲比，你好嗎？

9
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:46,600
You ask an intriguing question, Chandler Bing.
你問了一個很有趣的問題 錢德賓

10
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:55,680
Oh, my God! You're getting a massage? You never let me massage you.
天啊，你請人幫你按摩？ 你從來不讓我幫你按摩

11
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,610
Phoebe, I can explain.
菲比，我可以解釋

12
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:00,490
You see..
聽著…

13
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:03,180
God, I gotta get better at lying.
天啊，我得學怎麼說謊

14
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:06,220
You said you hate massages.
你說過你討厭按摩

15
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:10,660
Buy stamps. Pick up dry cleaning. Don't let Phoebe in.
去買郵票，拿乾洗的衣服 別讓菲比進來

16
00:01:12,330 --> 00:01:14,820
How long has this been going on?
你背著我這麼做多久了？

17
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:18,800
-Well, Alexandra has.. -It has a name?
-亞麗珊卓… -它還有名字？

18
00:01:20,410 --> 00:01:22,140
Phoebe, don't get upset.
菲比，別生氣

19
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:27,640
Okay. Oh, too late! I'm leaving. Come on, Chandler, let's go.
好吧，太遲了，我要走了 來吧，錢德，我們走

20
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:30,720
Well, I thought I'd..
我以為我…

21
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,750
Yeah, what the hell.
對，管它的

22
00:01:34,527 --> 00:01:36,586
The One With The Secret Closet
本集播出：秘密衣櫃

00:01:34,527 --> 00:01:36,586
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

23
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:16,190
One more push. Come on, we're almost there.
再推一次 加油，快好了

24
00:02:16,460 --> 00:02:22,130
I'm happy things worked out for us and we're having this baby. I love you.
我很高興我們能在一起 我們要生孩子了，我愛你

25
00:02:22,370 --> 00:02:24,460
I love you too.
我也愛你

26
00:02:24,710 --> 00:02:27,800
I hope it's not an inappropriate time to say..
我希望現在說這個 不會不是時候…

27
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,670
you're the best sex I've ever had.
你是我最棒的性伴侶

28
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:33,810
That's always appropriate.
你隨時都能那麼說

29
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:37,680
Okay, come on, one more push. One more push.
來吧，再推一次 再推一次

30
00:02:39,790 --> 00:02:42,310
There we go.
好了

31
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:48,830
Here is your beautiful baby. Congratulations.
你們的漂亮寶寶 恭喜

32
00:02:56,640 --> 00:03:00,900
I hope you're a better father than you are a friend!
希望你做爸爸 比做朋友稱職

33
00:03:05,550 --> 00:03:06,810
Joey!
喬伊

34
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:10,110
-What's going on? -Come feel my belly.
-發生了什麼事？ -快來摸摸我的肚子

35
00:03:10,890 --> 00:03:14,320
-The baby's kicking for the first time. -Really?
-這是寶寶第一次踢我 -真的嗎？

37
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,050
Yes.
對

38
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:18,850
You know what? Maybe you..
你知道嗎？或許你…

39
00:03:19,530 --> 00:03:24,260
Maybe you should come to me. I'm not wearing any bottoms.
或許你該走過來 我沒有穿褲子

41
00:03:26,770 --> 00:03:28,700
Oh, my God.
天啊

42
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:30,730
It's unbelievable!
太不可思議了

43
00:03:31,010 --> 00:03:34,530
Wow, she is kicking so much. She's like..
她踢得好厲害 她像是…

44
00:03:34,780 --> 00:03:37,770
Who's that annoying girl soccer player?
那個討厭的 女足球員是誰？

45
00:03:38,010 --> 00:03:40,950
-Mia Hamm? -Mia Hamm!
-米亞漢姆？ -米亞漢姆

46
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:45,550
-It's amazing. -One hand on the sheet, Joe.
-太神奇了 -抓住你的床單，喬伊

47
00:03:45,790 --> 00:03:47,850
Sorry.
抱歉

48
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:54,090
Hey, babe.
嘿，寶貝

49
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:59,460
We got a wedding gift from Bob and Faye Bing. They don't like us, do they?
巴伯跟菲伊賓送我們結婚禮物 他們不喜歡我們，對吧？

50
00:04:00,170 --> 00:04:04,160
Who says you can't get a nice punch bowl for under $6?
誰說買不到 六塊以下的高級雞尾酒碗？

51
00:04:04,370 --> 00:04:08,070
-Maybe we can take it back. -Where would we return it?
-或許我們能把它退回去 -我們要把它退到哪裡去？

52
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:11,400
How about to the street, from the balcony?
何不從陽台 把它丟到街上？

53
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:14,780
We can't do that. What if they come by for a visit?
我們不能那麼做 萬一他們來看我們呢？

54
00:04:14,950 --> 00:04:18,650
Let's cross that bridge when my aunt and uncle who I haven't seen in 15 years..
我們過橋去看 我15年沒看過的阿姨跟姨丈…

55
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:21,620
drop by unexpectedly and demand a giant bowl of punch.
給他們一個驚喜 要他們送我們大一點的雞尾酒碗

56
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:26,460
Why don't we just find a place for it?
我們為什麼不找個地方放它？

57
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,860
In that cabinet?
放在那個櫃子裡？

58
00:04:31,100 --> 00:04:36,590
That's for canned goods. Have you forgotten everything from orientation?
那是放罐頭食物的 你忘了每樣東西都要放在定位嗎？

59
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:41,470
How about the closet by the bathroom?
浴室旁邊的櫃子呢？

60
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:45,010
-Okay. Let me do it. -No, I'll do it.
-讓我來吧 -不，我來就行了

61
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:50,270
You have to relax and let me take care of things once in a while.
你得放輕鬆 偶爾把事情交給我來做

62
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:54,780
It's locked. You have to help me. Why is it locked?
上鎖了，你得幫幫我 為什麼上鎖了？

63
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:58,350
No reason. I keep private things in there.
沒有為什麼 我把私人物品放在那裡

64
00:04:58,660 --> 00:05:02,790
I've been here a while, and I've never seen what's in there.
我搬到這裡來一陣子了 從來沒看過裡面的東西

65
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,990
What is in there?
裡面放了什麼？

66
00:05:05,730 --> 00:05:07,030
Feminine stuff.
女人的東西

67
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:10,690
Don't try to make me uncomfortable with feminine stuff!
別想用女人的東西 來唬我

68
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:17,540
Nothing in there concerns you. If you love me, you'll just let it go.
那裡面沒有你喜歡的東西 如果你愛我，忘了這件事

69
00:05:18,550 --> 00:05:21,520
-Fine. -Thank you.
-好吧 -謝謝

70
00:05:26,490 --> 00:05:28,580
Love you.
我愛你

71
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:34,360
Hello, Chandler. Lovely day, huh? You.
錢德 今天天氣真好，是你

72
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:41,730
If it helps, Alexandra's only been massaging her for three years.
如果有幫助的話 亞麗珊卓已經幫她按摩了三年

73
00:05:43,370 --> 00:05:46,740
If! I said, if it helps.
我說如果有幫助的話

74
00:05:48,740 --> 00:05:52,010
Why won't you let me massage you?
你為什麼不讓我幫你按摩？

75
00:05:52,250 --> 00:05:56,770
I'd be self-conscious. You're my friend. I'd be naked.
我會無法放鬆 你是我的朋友，我得脫光衣服

76
00:05:57,050 --> 00:06:00,890
We lived together for years. I've seen you naked.
我們住在一起那麼多年 我看過你沒穿衣服

77
00:06:01,090 --> 00:06:04,580
That's different. We were roommates. And when?
那不一樣，我們是室友 那是什麼時候的事？

78
00:06:06,590 --> 00:06:09,390
I'm curious about the human body.
我對人體很好奇

79
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:13,570
You can understand why this would be weird.
你可以瞭解 為什麼我會覺得很奇怪

80
00:06:13,770 --> 00:06:16,500
I'm a professional and I'm really good.
我是專家 我真的很厲害

81
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:21,400
If you're uncomfortable, we can stop. Give me a chance. Please?
如果你覺得不舒服，我們就停止 給我一個機會，拜託

82
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:24,270
If it means that much to you.
如果你真的覺得很重要

83
00:06:24,550 --> 00:06:28,500
It does. How would you feel if you couldn't share your cooking?
沒錯，如果你無法分享你的廚藝 你會有什麼感覺？

84
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:33,050
Or how Ross would feel if he couldn't teach us about dragons.
如果羅斯沒辦法教我們龍的事 他會有什麼感覺？

85
00:06:34,090 --> 00:06:37,290
-Dinosaurs. -Potato, potahto.
-是恐龍 -都一樣

86
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:43,490
Ross, the baby's kicking.
羅斯，寶寶在踢

87
00:06:43,770 --> 00:06:45,790
What? It is?
什麼？是嗎？

88
00:06:51,010 --> 00:06:53,100
It's not kicking now.
她現在沒有在踢我

89
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:57,710
Although we would love to see you do that again.
雖然我們很想 看到你再做一次

90
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,840
When? What happened?
什麼時候？發生了什麼事？

91
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:03,810
Last night. I went into Joey's room, and he was sleeping.
昨晚我跑到喬伊的房間 他在睡覺

92
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:06,650
A dreamless sleep.
我沒有做夢

93
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:11,090
My God, the baby's kicking. That's great.
天啊，寶寶會踢了 真的是太棒了

94
00:07:11,330 --> 00:07:16,890
I wish I would have been there to feel the kicking for the first time.
我希望我可以摸到 寶寶第一次踢你的樣子

95
00:07:17,130 --> 00:07:20,860
I got some stuff going on if you want to feel.
如果你真的想摸 我的肚子正在咕咕叫

96
00:07:21,740 --> 00:07:23,570
I'll pass, but you look radiant.
我不要，但你看起來有母性光輝

97
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:32,110
I don't want to miss any more baby stuff. Here's my pager number.
我不想再錯過寶寶的事了 這是我新的呼叫器號碼

98
00:07:32,310 --> 00:07:35,910
Anytime anything pregnancy-related happens, use it.
只要發生跟懷孕有關的事 立刻通知我

99
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:39,280
I don't care if it's 3 a.m. and you want ice cream.
我不在乎那是凌晨三點 而你想吃冰淇淋

100
00:07:39,490 --> 00:07:42,120
Can I get a copy of that?
我能抄一份嗎？

101
00:07:46,060 --> 00:07:49,620
-Are you under the sheet? -Yes.
-你裹著床單嗎？ -對

102
00:07:51,300 --> 00:07:54,230
Great, let's begin.
好了，我們開始吧

103
00:08:01,610 --> 00:08:04,010
How's the pressure?
力道還可以吧？

104
00:08:04,910 --> 00:08:08,110
It's nice. Wow, Phoebe, you are good.
很不錯，菲比，你真的很厲害

105
00:08:08,350 --> 00:08:11,150
Stating the obvious, but thank you.
很明顯，謝謝你的誇獎

106
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:15,480
-And it's not weird, is it? -No.
-那一點都不奇怪，對吧？ -沒錯

107
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:20,720
That's right, you just enjoy.
沒錯，好好享受吧

108
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:25,290
Oh, yeah!
對

109
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:34,670
-Oh, yeah! -Okay.
-對 -好吧

110
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:38,440
Oh, God, Phoebe!
天啊，菲比

111
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:42,810
That's it! That's it, right there!
就是那樣，就是那裡

112
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:58,300
I wasn't trying to open your closet, I swear.
我發誓 我沒有試著打開你的櫃子

113
00:08:59,330 --> 00:09:05,200
Monica runs a pretty tight ship here, doesn't she? What are you doing?
摩妮卡管你很嚴，對吧？ 你在做什麼？

114
00:09:05,410 --> 00:09:08,670
Monica has a secret closet. She won't let me see it.
摩妮卡有秘密衣櫃 她不肯讓我看它

115
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:13,310
-Why not? -I don't know! What's she hiding?
-為什麼？ -我不知道，她在隱瞞什麼？

116
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:15,710
I don't know.
我不知道

117
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:18,410
I bet it's Richard.
我敢說是理查

118
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:21,220
-What? -Before you say I'm wrong..
-什麼？ -在你說我錯了之前…

119
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:22,720
let me ask you something.
我要問你一件事

120
00:09:22,890 --> 00:09:24,920
When was the last time you saw him?
你最後一次看到他是什麼時候的事？

121
00:09:25,860 --> 00:09:28,420
Why would she keep Richard in here?
她為什麼要把理查關在那裡？

122
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:30,890
Off the top of my head..
我不知道…

123
00:09:31,170 --> 00:09:34,530
maybe she's having her cake and eating it too.
或者她想魚與熊掌兼得

124
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:38,170
You being the "cake, " Richard being the "too."
你是「熊掌」 理查只是「魚」

125
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:41,440
-That was off the top of your head? -Yeah.
-那就是你想出來的理論？ -對

126
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:46,270
-Or.. -And here we go.
-或是… -又來了

127
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:51,010
I saw a movie where there was a door. Nobody knew what was behind it.
我看過一部電影裡有一扇門 沒有人知道裡面藏了什麼

128
00:09:51,290 --> 00:09:55,980
When they finally got it open, millions of bugs came pouring out..
最後他們把門打開後 好幾百萬隻蟲跑了出來…

129
00:09:56,190 --> 00:09:59,720
and they feasted on human flesh!
他們會吃人肉

130
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:04,530
It wouldn't kill you to respect your wife's privacy!
尊重你老婆的隱私 不會要你的命

131
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:12,440
Stupid closet full of bugs!
塞滿蟲的笨衣櫃

132
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:18,210
Joey, something feels weird and not good weird. I don't..
喬伊，我覺得怪怪的 那不是好事，我不…

133
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:20,610
When my sisters were pregnant..
我妹妹懷孕時…

134
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:24,180
they got weird feelings and it was always nothing.
她們都覺得怪怪的 結果根本沒事

135
00:10:24,420 --> 00:10:26,110
-Really? -Absolutely.
-真的嗎？ -當然

136
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:30,760
But we'll stop by the hospital just to be sure. I'll page Ross.
但我們得到醫院檢查一下 我會呼叫羅斯

137
00:10:30,990 --> 00:10:37,190
Rach, look at me. Everything's fine. Trust me. Take my hand. Here we go.
瑞秋，看著我，一切都會沒事的 相信我，握著我的手，我們走吧

138
00:10:37,430 --> 00:10:39,490
Crushing bones!
我快骨折了

139
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:43,030
Good thing we're going to a hospital.
還好我們要去醫院

140
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:44,830
-Open it. -Why'd you..
-打開它 -你為什麼…

141
00:10:45,010 --> 00:10:47,070
Watch your feet. There's bugs everywhere.
小心你的腳 到處都有蟲

142
00:10:56,050 --> 00:10:58,210
-So? -She's fine.
-結果呢？ -她沒事

143
00:10:58,420 --> 00:11:03,480
She had Braxton Hicks contractions. Mild discomfort in the uterine wall.
她出現不規則的子宮收縮 那是子宮壁出現中度不適的現象

144
00:11:03,690 --> 00:11:08,690
Mild discomfort? I take it you've had one of these Braxton thingies?
中度不適？ 我想你也出現過那種現象

145
00:11:08,900 --> 00:11:10,730
-Everything's normal? -Yes.
-一切都很正常？ -對

146
00:11:10,930 --> 00:11:13,130
-There's no danger? -No.
-沒有危險？ -對

147
00:11:13,330 --> 00:11:16,500
Contractions can be unnerving, but she's fine.
收縮雖然會不舒服 但她沒事

148
00:11:16,740 --> 00:11:21,540
Thank you, doctor. And thank you for being nice and calm.
謝謝你，醫生 謝謝你這麼溫和冷靜

149
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:25,770
I wasn't calm! I've never been more scared in my life.
我一點都不冷靜 我從來沒有這麼害怕過

150
00:11:26,210 --> 00:11:31,010
-You said everything was okay. -What do I know? I'm not a doctor.
-你說一切都會沒事的 -我知道什麼？我不是醫生

151
00:11:31,850 --> 00:11:35,150
-But everything is okay. I'm fine. -You sure?
-但一切都沒事，我沒事 -你確定？

152
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:39,190
Yes. I got half a mind to contract that doctor's uterus.
對，我真希望 那個醫生的子宮也會收縮

153
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:42,490
Mild discomfort! What's he talking about?
中度不適 他到底在胡說什麼？

154
00:11:42,730 --> 00:11:44,390
-Is everything okay? -Yes.
-沒事吧？ -沒事

155
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:47,690
Your page said, "Come to the hospital." What happened?
你呼叫我說「趕到醫院來」 發生了什麼事？

